id: pm-a8is
title: Keep changelog checks stable when Windows checks out CRLF text
description: "The sweep PR Windows documentation gate passed tracker health but failed both prepared-release and historical changelog checks. An isolated checkout of the exact pushed commit with core.autocrlf=true reproduced the failure (505 CRLF lines); checking out the same commit with LF made the unchanged npm run changelog:check pass. The generator compares exact bytes, while the repository has no canonical LF policy for CHANGELOG.md. A persistent fix requires repository attributes or generator/checker behavior, outside this tracker-only sweep."
type: Chore
status: open
priority: 2
tags[3]: changelog,ci,"gh:unbraind/pm-presets#218"
created_at: "2026-11-16T16:00:28.110Z"
